      `the bulk is reduced to (or to less than) the aggregate of the quantities due to a single buyer under separate contracts relating to that bulk` IS A BOOLEAN
      `he is the only buyer to whom goods are then due out of that bulk` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the date the bulk is reduced` IS A DATE
      `the date asked about` IS A DATE
