-- src:688 | to secure acceptance or payment of the bill of exchange, the buyer is
-- src:689 | bound to return the bill of lading if he does not honour the bill of
-- src:690 | exchange, and if he wrongfully retains the bill of lading, the property
-- src:691 | in the goods does not pass to him.
@ref s 19(3) property (src:686-691)
