    BRANCH
        IF `the seller draws on the buyer for the price and transmits the bill of exchange and bill of lading to the buyer together to secure acceptance or payment of the bill of exchange` AND `the buyer does not honour the bill of exchange` AND `the buyer wrongfully retains the bill of lading`
        THEN
            -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "if he wrongfully retains the bill of lading, the property in the goods does not pass to him"
